{
  "heading": "Typed model mapping: Tac",
  "axis": "language",
  "target": "web",
  "summary": "A service injects the converter and uses typed models for both implicit copying and public projection.",
  "body": "Click Map to see the same Summary as in the Yon example. The injected ProductConverter first copies Product without a Convert marker, then projects Summary using its signatures and the explicit kind override. The target models omit secret fields in nested objects and lists.\n\nModels belong to client/models and the converter to client/converters. A mapping needs no Setup or external adapter: it reads only its argument. The JavaScript signatures use JSDoc types and the TypeScript signatures use model interfaces.",
